{"record_id": "23383961", "status": "PASS", "disposition_by": "root", "created_utc": "2026-10-25T04:56:02.590784+00:00", "approved_scope": "In the normalized schlicht class S, global maximizers of Re[a2+i*10^-24*(a4-3a3)] exist, and EVERY global maximizer omits an actual analytic slit with nonmonotone continuous polar argument, signed OUTWARD radial angle, and ordinary unsigned radial angle. Both monotonic directions are excluded; no maximizing-map formula or uniqueness is required. The proof gives strict signs on an actual omitted subarc, not merely a formal positive trajectory.", "root_clearance": "Later root scientific clearance controls the exact stated scope; original scope-only pending/null/false verdict fields are preserved. This source-bound config remains unrendered and unpublished.", "root_clearance_file": "verification/root-clearance-23383961-20261025.json", "root_clearance_sha256": "2a9214e52b408d2a67a4aef4d6887b8cf86f8eb46f99423ad977c4a8cf847122", "root_clearance_record": {"utc": "2026-10-25T04:53:58.109333+00:00", "record_id": "23383961", "sheet_row": 74, "status": "PASS_REWRITTEN", "disposition_by": "root", "approved_scope": "In the normalized schlicht class S, global maximizers of Re[a2+i*10^-24*(a4-3a3)] exist, and EVERY global maximizer omits an actual analytic slit with nonmonotone continuous polar argument, signed OUTWARD radial angle, and ordinary unsigned radial angle. Both monotonic directions are excluded; no maximizing-map formula or uniqueness is required. The proof gives strict signs on an actual omitted subarc, not merely a formal positive trajectory.", "root_reading": "Root read the entire actual five-page published manuscript BEFORE the favorable reviewer reports, then fully read all three COMPLETE final reports and exact verdicts. Root independently assessed Koebe/nonconstant support comparison, every-maximizer coefficient bounds, odd-root injectivity and area tail, actual-tip Schwarz distance direction, exact Laurent differential/double-cover signs, Rouché inverse and oddness, actual-slit open/closed continuation, uniform epsilon/eta remainder budget, signed angle initial limit and separate unsigned interior-zero argument. Root read actual Duren1981pp352-355 and visually inspected originalpp352/355 for differential and angle conventions, complete Hayman-LinghamProblem6.72onp143, and complete Pavlovic-PelaezTheorem1/Eq1.4onpp909-910. Classical theorem statements/hypotheses are checked; their full historical proofs are not independently re-proved.", "source_receipt_sha256": "694bd1f9f680612d3080557f91eb59e59ecd8e67f5383a13764a39a454656401", "source_receipts": {"sources/receipt.json": {"sha256": "694bd1f9f680612d3080557f91eb59e59ecd8e67f5383a13764a39a454656401", "files": 2}}, "root_custody_receipt": "papers/23383961/reviews/root/custody-recheck-20261025.json", "root_custody_receipt_sha256": "2320867cd6d55087d85d8e237c9332f01bf450d03b5f2559157270db6ed367f7", "root_review_seals_rehashed": [{"path": "papers/23383961/reviews/scope/SEAL.json", "sha256": "5ae541bfd9ef5158067b10e5e72af37408163031c6f8fc691239ff70eedee53d", "bindings_checked": 70}, {"path": "papers/23383961/reviews/analytic/SEAL.json", "sha256": "d0cc79d11a175dc43ed46d792fbec4e75d9c57a02b615378d35d2a0e4692eca4", "bindings_checked": 32}, {"path": "papers/23383961/reviews/adversarial/FINAL_SEAL.json", "sha256": "a3cc585d2cd532bf094c6c90245e1df549c6c3cedc0e117910faf78f82052ab8", "bindings_checked": 57}], "root_public_assets_rehashed": 2, "source_files_unchanged": 259, "root_extracted_outer_members_compared": 255, "hidden_archive_members": 12, "additional_reader_pdfs": 0, "pdf_sha256": "a6d227d606fda3e68adc6db4eab462ee3f12b0544a201121b5c3a21aa5099e3d", "supplement_sha256": "58853fd56272184efe8232c58c356b1a669ba43032e3c4f35e4b17e317898f51", "reviews": {"scope": {"report": "papers/23383961/reviews/scope/REVIEW.md", "report_sha256": "ad1148679c4846968450052ff98ba4c288360857741edb4087977da0e5946dd2", "verdict": "papers/23383961/reviews/scope/verdic