al proofs.", "Prior point-evaluation and derivative-evaluation positive results, classical methods and original problem are credited. Historical comparisons in manuscriptSection5 beyond the checked primary interfaces were not comprehensively independently re-audited. Omit exact unverified absence/example-overlap assertions from the public page.", "Duren2013/2014commentary, Hibschweiler1995 and other historical leads remain uninspected in this current pass. No historical firstness, exhaustive novelty or continued worldwide openness claim; preserved original abstract is identified as original.", "Extensive AI research and review are not independent human/journal peer review or proof-assistant certification. Frozen historical favorable assessments and PASS strings were not the mathematical proof basis."], "scope_gate_resolution": "Original scope-only pending scientific verdict is preserved; later independent mathematical reviews and root actual-proof/primary-interface assessment resolve the stated theorem for page preparation.", "source_repair": false, "human_peer_review": false, "formal_machine_verification": false, "follow_up": null, "authorization": "Prepare source-bound publication/promotion only. Full original abstract and exact date/version/scope required; actual rendered-copy, local/live HTTP, browser and native Sheet publication gates remain. Native AA URL stays blank until verified live."}, "pdf_sha256": "a6d227d606fda3e68adc6db4eab462ee3f12b0544a201121b5c3a21aa5099e3d", "supplement_sha256": "58853fd56272184efe8232c58c356b1a669ba43032e3c4f35e4b17e317898f51", "publication_sha256": "612ffcb71b262816975cc36e7bac77c7f3c98abc223a03935fa79597c21f5f0e", "source_receipt_sha256": "694bd1f9f680612d3080557f91eb59e59ecd8e67f5383a13764a39a454656401", "metadata_path": "sources/record.json", "metadata_sha256": "9109f682be5c735d8e49a50aa1b332a1745308433ee50a887fd9e30e23dbc1e4", "source_files": [{"name": "verification_package.zip", "url": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/233839